        "faraidh_tooltip_body": [.english: "Faraidh is the Islamic science of inheritance distribution after death. This tool calculates each heir's Quranic share (furud), residue (asabah), blocking rules (hajb), and special adjustments (ʿawl when shares exceed the estate, radd when surplus remains). Use it for planning and education—always consult a qualified scholar for binding legal rulings.", .indonesian: "Faraidh is the Islamic science of inheritance distribution after death. This tool calculates each heir's Quranic share (furud), residue (asabah), blocking rules (hajb), and special adjustments (ʿawl when shares exceed the estate, radd when surplus remains). Use it for planning and education—always consult a qualified scholar for binding legal rulings.", .malay: "Faraidh is the Islamic science of inheritance distribution after death. This tool calculates each heir's Quranic share (furud), residue (asabah), blocking rules (hajb), and special adjustments (ʿawl when shares exceed the estate, radd when surplus remains). Use it for planning and education—always consult a qualified scholar for binding legal rulings."],
