        "night_first_third_body": [.english: "Night has begun. Get some rest, and Kīmi will remind you when the last third of the night arrives.", .indonesian: "Malam telah tiba. Istirahatlah dengan cukup, Kīmi akan mengingatkanmu saat sepertiga akhir malam tiba.", .malay: "Malam telah tiba. Berehatlah secukupnya, Kīmi akan mengingatkanmu apabila sepertiga akhir malam tiba."],
