        "night_midnight_body": [.english: "It’s midnight. If you’re still awake, don’t forget to pray Witr before resting.", .indonesian: "Sudah tengah malam. Jika belum tidur, jangan lupa menunaikan Witir sebelum beristirahat.", .malay: "Sudah tengah malam. Jika belum tidur, jangan lupa menunaikan solat Witir sebelum berehat."],
